  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Development of a Duplex Droplet Digital Polymerase Chain Reaction Assay for Simultaneous Quantitative Detection of Two Erwinia Species (2024) in Research in Plant Disease. 1 citation.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Development of a Duplex Droplet Digital Polymerase Chain Reaction Assay for Simultaneous Quantitative Detection of Two Erwinia Species (2024) in Research in Plant Disease is authored by Lin He, Mi‐Hyun Lee and Jun Yu. Topics: Duplex (building), Polymerase chain reaction, Digital polymerase chain reaction, Chemistry and Real-time polymerase chain reaction.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">1 citations (OpenAlex). Citing venues include Australasian Plant Pathology.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
